#: ../../source/docs/reference-frame-traxxas-stampede.rst:5
#: 5a116b2bb8bf460f97118e26f0685f99
msgid "Traxxas Stampede 4WD Truck"
msgstr "Traxxas Stampede 四驱越野车"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frame-traxxas-stampede.rst:7
#: 95360659dab141ddb3ac54aa855a21d5
msgid ""
"This article explains how to add Rover running on a Pixhawk to the `Traxxas "
"Stampede 4x4 monster truck "
"<https://traxxas.com/products/models/electric/67086stampede4x4vxl>`__."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何在 `Traxxas Stampede 4x4 monster truck "
"<https://traxxas.com/products/models/electric/67086stampede4x4vxl>`__ 上加装运行 "
"Rover 的 Pixhawk。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frame-traxxas-stampede.rst:10
#: 9a9a67af3919468a8537355f9a258907
msgid "Wiring diagram"
msgstr "接线图"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frame-traxxas-stampede.rst:12
#: 7ac1da41d1244006b711538cc13539bf
msgid ""
"The wiring diagram below shows a method for directly powering the steering "
"servo from the Stampede's ESC."
msgstr "下面的接线图展示了一种直接由 Stampede 的 ESC 为转向舵机供电的方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frame-traxxas-stampede.rst:18
#: 28e092b7c4e949ed884efec275829f72
msgid "No solder connection of ESC and steering servo power"
msgstr "免焊接连接 ESC 与转向舵机电源"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frame-traxxas-stampede.rst:20
#: ecfa5889e3504c24ac668874237dc62e
msgid ""
"The photograph below illustrates a no solder method for connecting the ESC "
"and steering servo power wire:"
msgstr "下图展示了一种免焊接连接 ESC 和转向舵机电源线的方法："

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frame-traxxas-stampede.rst:26
#: 180cff702c8241b38ad37ac7075cf988
msgid ""
"Remove the power pin sockets from the end of the connectors that plug into "
"the autopilot on the servo and ESC cables."
msgstr "从插入自动驾驶仪的舵机和 ESC 线缆连接器末端取下电源针脚插座。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frame-traxxas-stampede.rst:27
#: e986a6c7e29a4726b98f35b3d76616d5
msgid ""
"Strip them loose of the 3 wire cables and connect them with a small piece of"
" wire or (wire wrap pin)."
msgstr "将其从三芯线缆中分离，用一小段导线（或绕线针）将其连接在一起。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frame-traxxas-stampede.rst:28
#: 3de5a860aa6f49488b7cd69946f1f1e7
msgid ""
"Put heat shrink tubing over the joined sockets and shrink it on with a heat "
"gun. (Shown before connection)."
msgstr "在连接好的插座上套上热缩管并用热风枪收缩固定（图示为连接前状态）。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frame-traxxas-stampede.rst:31
#: ff387eac848646b5866dd84fbcd2a261
msgid "RC Setup"
msgstr "遥控设置"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frame-traxxas-stampede.rst:33
#: c9729c85b748477f965244146347aea5
msgid ""
"This truck uses the FRSky Delta 8 multi-protocol receiver which is "
"compatible with Hitec and Futaba RC transmitters. The Delta 8 provides the "
"required PPM-Sum communication with the autopilot using a Futaba or Hitec "
"transmitter."
msgstr ""
"该车使用 FRSky Delta 8 多协议接收机，兼容 Hitec 和 Futaba 遥控发射机。Delta 8 通过 Futaba 或 Hitec "
"发射机向自动驾驶仪提供所需的 PPM-Sum 通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frame-traxxas-stampede.rst:42
#: 75f5c87e581848bb9f2c316000a42840
msgid "Mounting setup"
msgstr "安装方式"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frame-traxxas-stampede.rst:44
#: 538dab83fbf24ab295888dd1269dc85f
msgid ""
"The 1/8\" 6061 aluminum plate is excessive (and required heavier springs on "
"the suspension) but functions well."
msgstr "1/8 英寸 6061 铝板略显厚重（并需要更换更硬的悬架弹簧），但使用效果良好。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frame-traxxas-stampede.rst:47
#: b4c315c448924d8aa140f121dc24b93d
msgid ""
"In addition to the autopilot and receiver, the safety button and buzzer have"
" also been mounted to the plate"
msgstr "除自动驾驶仪和接收机外，安全按钮和蜂鸣器也已安装在铝板上"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frame-traxxas-stampede.rst:48
#: e656ca40551b4746aa2055c77a2dc06b
msgid ""
"Slightly longer screws were used to install the plate and body mounting "
"studs (a very simple installation)"
msgstr "使用稍长的螺丝安装底板和车身安装柱（安装非常简便）"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frame-traxxas-stampede.rst:49
#: e8a5076962f94ecea68a727f10a25166
msgid ""
"The receiver is mounted with heavy duty Velcro and the autopilot will be "
"remounted with Kyosho Zeal gel squares"
msgstr "接收机用强力魔术贴固定，自动驾驶仪将用 Kyosho Zeal 凝胶垫重新安装"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frame-traxxas-stampede.rst:51
#: c40a7eab4b674651a433a3f93dc82dad
msgid ""
"Cutouts for safety button access and the buzzer can be seen in the truck's "
"body below."
msgstr "车身下方可以看到安全按钮访问孔和蜂鸣器开孔。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frame-traxxas-stampede.rst:56
#: 304e09a6f2fe484ebbddf5b4b967373c
msgid ""
"this uses a Hitec Aurora 9 transmitter so throttle (channel 3) was mapped to"
" the right (self centering) elevator stick."
msgstr "本机使用 Hitec Aurora 9 发射机，因此油门（通道 3）被映射到右侧（自动回中）升降舵摇杆。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frame-traxxas-stampede.rst:57
#: 6d8fa19cf739428990002867fc4955eb
msgid "steering (channel 1) was mapped to the left rudder stick."
msgstr "转向（通道 1）被映射到左侧方向舵摇杆。"
